  "subdivision_of_building": "Song school (vestry), churchyard, associated works to the chancel, and master's garden. ",
  "status": "Application Under Consideration",
  "description": "Refurbishment and extension of the existing north vestry of the Temple Church. The proposals include two new single-storey extensions to create a Song School and separate Choristers’ entrance with associated works to the Grade I listed building including the refurbishment of the existing vestry. The proposals will provide level access and improved safeguarding for the Church, choir, musicians, congregation and visitors. Externally the proposals include the relandscaping of the North Churchyard with a new ramp and stair providing step-free access to the Song School and the west door of the Church.",
